1
00:00:05,889 --> 00:00:08,059
(Leonard:)So... when you say

2
00:00:08,224 --> 00:00:10,724
(Leonard:)you're not going
to freak out about the DVD,

3
00:00:10,894 --> 00:00:12,494
(Leonard:)here's what that means.

4
00:00:13,663 --> 00:00:15,073
(Leonard:)Don't fixate on it,

5
00:00:15,231 --> 00:00:17,041
(Leonard:)don't wake me up
in the middle of the night,

6
00:00:17,200 --> 00:00:20,440
(Leonard:)or nag me through the door
while I'm on the toilet.

7
00:00:21,771 --> 00:00:24,341
(Sheldon:)Okay, first, talking to you
while you're on the toilet

8
00:00:24,507 --> 00:00:26,787
(Sheldon:)isn't exactly a picnic for me either.

9
00:00:27,510 --> 00:00:30,680
(Sheldon:)Remember, when you can hear me,
I can hear you.

10
00:00:32,415 --> 00:00:34,695
(Sheldon:)And, second,
you completely disregard

11
00:00:34,851 --> 00:00:37,691
(Sheldon:)how uncomfortable
unresolved issues are for me.

12
00:00:37,854 --> 00:00:41,354
It's like, an itch in my brain
I can't scratch.

13
00:00:42,292 --> 00:00:45,762
(Leonard:)When I broke my arm I used
to stick a coat hanger down there.

14
00:00:48,298 --> 00:00:50,938
(Leonard:)You ever try that?
Maybe go in through the ear?

15
00:00:51,067 --> 00:00:53,477
(Sheldon:)You wouldn't make jokes
if you could feel the way I feel.

16
00:00:54,137 --> 00:00:55,947
(Leonard:)Well, I don't know how to do that.

17
00:00:57,774 --> 00:00:59,444
(Sheldon:)How about this?

18
00:00:59,609 --> 00:01:02,389
(Sheldon:)I promise I won't pester you
about the DVD.

